    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Spy Violet is a Top Down-Synchronous-Stealth game where Agent Violet have to infiltrate Havvatopia City and prevent dimensional war</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing Grammphics</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just kidding, the graphic is trash lol\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronous Movement\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronous is a term that I made myself lol</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronous is turn based but you and enemies using turn together at the same time\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable = NPC\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything that can be interacted is NPC\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact to gather intel that can be useful for the mission\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth &amp; Time Leap\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak around guard, but those guards cannot be killed / take down\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s okay, Agent Violet can time leap if she spotted by guards</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free, Short, and Small!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 100% free, with no ads and no microtransactions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a really short game; you probably can finish this game in under 30 minutes.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Spy Violet is a Top Down-Synchronous-Stealth game where Agent Violet have to infiltrate Havvatopia City and prevent dimensional war</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing Grammphics</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just kidding, the graphic is trash lol\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronous Movement\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronous is a term that I made myself lol</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronous is turn based but you and enemies using turn together at the same time\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable = NPC\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything that can be interacted is NPC\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact to gather intel that can be useful for the mission\u00a0</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth &amp; Time Leap\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak around guard, but those guards cannot be killed / take down\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s okay, Agent Violet can time leap if she spotted by guards</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free, Short, and Small!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 100% free, with no ads and no microtransactions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a really short game; you probably can finish this game in under 30 minutes.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
